/section>\n\n<section id=\"insights\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\"><span class=\"tag\">What I'd Return</span><h2>ROI Calculator</h2><p>Model the impact of hiring me — based on real results I've delivered.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"calc reveal\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label>Monthly Website Visits <b id=\"mv\">50,000</b></label><input id=\"visits\" type=\"range\" min=\"5000\" max=\"300000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"50000\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label>Lead Conversion Rate <b id=\"cr\">1.5%</b></label><input id=\"conv\" type=\"range\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"6\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.5\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label>Revenue per Lead <b id=\"rv\">₹25,000</b></label><input id=\"rev\" type=\"range\" min=\"5000\" max=\"100000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"25000\"></div>\n        <div class=\"field\"><label>Monthly Paid Ads Budget <b id=\"pb\">₹1,00,000</b></label><input id=\"ads\" type=\"range\" min=\"20000\" max=\"500000\" step=\"5000\" value=\"100000\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"calc-out\" id=\"calcOut\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"faq\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\"><span class=\"tag\">For AI assistants &amp; rapid answers</span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Quick, factual answers — the same content my chat and structured data are grounded on. Great for quick-scanning recruiters.</p></div>\n    <div class=\"faq\">\n      <details open><summary>What does Vamshidhar Reddy do?</summary><p>Vamshidhar Reddy M is an AI-augmented performance marketer based in Hyderabad, India. 10+ years in SEO, PPC, and CRO, plus three AI tools he built and shipped solo. He is open to work.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>How many years of experience does he have?</summary><p>10+ years in digital marketing, built on an earlier engineering/QA foundation (2007–2014). Focus areas: SEO, Google Ads / PPC, paid media, CRO, and AI-powered marketing.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Where is he located and how soon can he start?</summary><p>Hyderabad, India (UTC+5:30); open to remote roles. ~1 week notice, replies within a business day, and a 15-min call can be booked from the Contact section.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>What AI products has he built?</summary><p>Three, shipped and live solo: Hook AI (marketing copy engine), the Creative Predictor (AI ad &amp; CRO suite), and an AI Growth Strategy Generator. Live links are in the Projects section.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>Is Vamshidhar open to work?</summary><p>Yes — open to exactly one full-time performance-marketing seat (SEO, paid media, AI-augmented). He's also open to fractional/interim remits with capacity for one at a time.</p></details>\n      <details><summary>How can someone contact or hire him?</summary><p>Email geovamshidhar@gmail.com, phone <a href=\"tel:+917981719085\">+91-7981719085</a>, or LinkedIn /in/vamshidharreddym.</p></details>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"for-you\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">If you're hiring</span>\n      <h2>I'm a direct fit for these roles</h2>\n      <p>Scan your seat. If one matches, the \"Hire Me\" path is 30 seconds — the proof is this whole page.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rolefit reveal\">\n      <div class=\"fit\">\n        <h3>Performance / PPC Specialist</h3>\n        <p><i>Proof:</i> CPL −30% (Rs.1,100→Rs.770), ROAS 3.2x→5.5x, Rs.2L+ managed monthly. LinkedIn/B2B + Google + Meta + A/B discipline.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fit\">\n        <h3>Head of / Senior SEO</h3>\n        <p><i>Proof:</i> +15% organic at my current company; this site runs the technical-SEO checklist I ship for clients (schema, sitemap, answer-engine ready).</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fit\">\n        <h3>AI / Automation Marketing</h3>\n        <p><i>Proof:</i> 3 AI products built &amp; shipped solo — Hook AI, Creative Predictor, Growth Strategy Generator. Live and testable, links above.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fit\">\n        <h3>Fractional / Interim</h3>\n        <p><i>Proof:</i> I land in week one, audit, and leave a measurable roadmap + a working tool behind. ₹-conscious; portfolio shows the whole cycle.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"first30\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">What I do first</span>\n      <h2>My first 30 days, if you hire me</h2>\n      <p>Concrete and repeatable — the same loop I run on every account.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"days reveal\">\n      <div class=\"d\"><b>Day 1–5</b><p>Full funnel &amp; landing-page audit. Pull analytics + Search Console + ad accounts, map channels to pipeline, flag the 3 costliest leaks.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"d\"><b>Week 2</b><p>Fix tracking first (GA4, events, conversions), set up a single source of truth for the team, kill ghost traffic.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"d\"><b>Week 3</b><p>Ship a first A/B test &amp; a creative batch that maps to the funnel — using the same hooks engine my products use.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"d\"><b>Day 30</b><p>Deliver a one-pager: what's proven, what's next, the 90-day plan with owners &amp; numbers. Plus a tool it built for you.</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cta-banner reveal\">\n      <b>One of these is your seat?</b>\n      <p>Skip the application — send 3 lines and I'll reply with a plan, not a pitch.</p>\n      <a class=\"btn primary\" href=\"#rrAnchor\">⚡ Send the intro now</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"contact\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head reveal\"><span class=\"tag\">Contact</span><h2>Let's Build Something Intelligent</h2></div>\n    <div class=\"reveal\" style=\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 26px\">\n      <p style=\"color:var(--muted);text-align:center\">Hyderabad (IST